# Testing and workflow

- Write engine tests before or alongside engine code. A change to `tst/sim` without a test is incomplete.
- Determinism: any test that involves randomness uses a fixed seed and asserts exact values.
- Property tests (Hypothesis) for invariants: ledger debits equal credits; attributes stay in [1, 20]; cash never changes without a ledger entry; headcount equals active employments.
- Golden snapshots (`backend/tests/golden/`): 10 fixed seeds run headless; KPI snapshot per turn stored as JSON. Never edit by hand. Regenerate only with `--update-golden` and note why in `CHANGELOG.md`.
- Front-end: Vitest for components and formatters; Playwright smoke test that a new game loads, Continue advances one month, and the date changes.
- Never weaken an assertion to make a test pass. If the test is wrong, explain why in the summary.
- Finish every change with `make check` green.
